1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,889
Nine out of ten deaf babies are born to
hearing parents.

2
00:00:04,589 --> 00:00:07,557
Overnight, those parents need a new language.

3
00:00:07,557 --> 00:00:09,799
But learning from a video is hard.

4
00:00:09,799 --> 00:00:13,888
The signer faces you, so you flip every
movement in your head.

5
00:00:13,888 --> 00:00:16,856
And nobody tells you if your hands are right.

6
00:00:17,556 --> 00:00:19,010
So I built Signsprout.

7
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:21,785
It opens from a link in the Quest browser.

8
00:00:21,785 --> 00:00:25,023
You stay seated, and all you need are your
hands.

9
00:00:25,723 --> 00:00:26,855
No wall of text.

10
00:00:26,855 --> 00:00:31,383
Hold up your hands, pick the hand you write
with, and touch your

11
00:00:31,383 --> 00:00:34,567
chin, so every sign lands in the right place.

12
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:37,428
Every sign has four steps.

13
00:00:37,428 --> 00:00:38,508
First, watch.

14
00:00:38,508 --> 00:00:43,578
Sprout shows it face to face, mirrored, so
it's easy to copy.

15
00:00:44,278 --> 00:00:48,107
Then glowing guide hands appear right where
your hands are.

16
00:00:48,107 --> 00:00:50,833
Put your hands inside them and sign along.

17
00:00:50,833 --> 00:00:54,921
Signsprout reads twenty-five joints on each
hand, and tells you

18
00:00:54,921 --> 00:00:55,700
what to fix.

19
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,529
Now it's your turn, from memory.

20
00:00:58,529 --> 00:01:02,453
It checks the handshape, then the place, then
the movement.

21
00:01:02,453 --> 00:01:06,311
And for signs at your face, a mirror shows you
your hands.

22
00:01:07,011 --> 00:01:10,744
Get it right, and a new plant sprouts in your
garden.

23
00:01:11,444 --> 00:01:13,497
Your garden is your progress.

24
00:01:13,497 --> 00:01:18,239
Plants grow as signs move into long-term
memory, and droop a little

25
00:01:18,239 --> 00:01:20,009
when it's time to review.

26
00:01:20,009 --> 00:01:22,911
Five minutes a day fits before bath time.

27
00:01:23,611 --> 00:01:27,600
On your phone, tell Sprout what you need, like
words for bath time.

28
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:31,470
The built-in coach plans from signs Signsprout
can check, and the

29
00:01:31,470 --> 00:01:33,078
plan waits in your headset.

30
00:01:33,778 --> 00:01:34,604
Left-handed?

31
00:01:34,604 --> 00:01:35,775
Every sign flips.

32
00:01:35,775 --> 00:01:40,320
There's a limited finger range, high contrast
and calm motion, and

33
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,556
you can press any button just by looking at
it.

34
00:01:44,256 --> 00:01:47,783
Signsprout is a practice partner, not a
translator.

35
00:01:47,783 --> 00:01:52,279
It's here to help families find their first
signs, and then their

36
00:01:52,279 --> 00:01:54,700
way to Deaf teachers and community.

37
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:56,335
Signsprout.

38
00:01:56,335 --> 00:02:00,244
Your first ASL signs, with your own two hands.
